#: app/templates/index.html:16
msgid "PictoTree: A free, digital pictogram binder."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:17
msgid "(Currently under development)"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:19
msgid ""
"PictoTree is a tool designed to simplify the daily use of communication "
"binders (like PECS). The goal is not to replace paper, but to offer a "
"practical mobile alternative that is completely free and respects your "
"privacy."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:21
msgid "What the app offers:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:23
msgid "Pocket-sized (offline):"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:23
msgid ""
"Always have your binder on your phone to communicate outside (in stores, "
"on walks), without needing an internet connection."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:24
msgid "Built-in Arasaac search:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:24
msgid ""
"A search engine to directly find and add pictograms from the official "
"Arasaac database."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:25
msgid "Your own photos:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:25
msgid ""
"A secure import system to use photos of your surroundings or objects as "
"private pictograms."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:26
msgid "PDF Generator:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:26
msgid ""
"A tool to easily create and print pictogram boards to update your actual "
"physical binder."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:31
msgid "Login / Register"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:47
msgid "The Tree Builder (Web)"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:50
msgid ""
"Construct and organize your communication structures using a hierarchical"
" interface. Drag and drop pictograms to build logical paths tailored to "
"the user's specific needs. Once saved, these trees can be easily imported"
" into the mobile application."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:65
msgid "PictoTree Mobile App (Android)"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:68
msgid ""
"The native mobile application uses a spatial navigation system (View 4) "
"to browse through imported trees. It includes integrated Text-to-Speech "
"(TTS) for vocal feedback and works fully offline to ensure communication "
"is always available."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:83
msgid "Pictogram Bank (Management)"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:86
msgid ""
"Centralize your visual vocabulary. Search and import icons from the "
"ARASAAC database or upload your own personal images. Organize them into "
"folders to keep your library structured and ready for use in your trees "
"or lists."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:101
msgid "List & Print Tool (Paper Support)"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/index.html:104
msgid ""
"Generate customizable pictogram lists designed for printing. This tool "
"provides various layout options to create physical communication boards, "
"schedules, or educational materials directly from your digital "
"collection."
msgstr ""

